[315.160341, "o", "9:Brief 09 supersedes earlier hold-timing wording in narrative drafts and partially defers Brief 07 on compliance_hold date comparison.\r\n1201:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n1213:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I) — field notes\r\n1423:Continued from Brief 07. Set `policy_waiver` when final status is `approved`,\r\n"]
